<title>ITALY: Italy's construction workers strike for better pay.</title>
<headline>Italy's construction workers strike for better pay.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>More than a million Italian construction workers went on strike on Tuesday to press demands for a new national contract, unions said.</p>
<p>The 8-hour strike by some 1.2 million workers stopped activities at most construction sites as demonstrations were held in several cities.</p>
<p>Talks between unions and employers' groups over a new national contract broke down on February 5.</p>
</text>
